<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sondor half year share slightly up, no dividend.</title>
<headline>Sondor half year share slightly up, no dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     11.65	 vs  11.53</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs   -</p>
<p>Retained income at</p>
<p>    end of period	   11.50	 vs  6.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    4.11	 vs  4.35</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.50	 vs  1.57</p>
<p>    Turnover		  30.07	 vs 27.53</p>
<p>Full name:  Sondor Industries Ltd (Industrial/engineering)</p>
<p>NOTE - The directors said an amount equivalent to 17.5 cents per debenture would be paid to shareholders registered in the books of the company at the close of business on November 29 1996. Cheques owuld be posted around December 14.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
